1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Most farmers spray
on the dealer's word.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Kom Bish says whether
to spray at all.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,000
TODO-C: narration line 2

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The farmer reads the consent text
and ticks the box.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:36,000
A rice-leaf photo is uploaded.
(Sample image: RiceLeafBD test split)

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
"From the photo, this looks like
bacterial leaf blight."

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:54,000
No insecticide needed —
fix the fertiliser

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The same reviewed text plays
as a recorded human voice.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:15,000
"Before spraying anything else,
talk to your agriculture officer."

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Blast: Spray correctly,
and stay safe

11
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,000
A safety clip plays
with every spray answer.

12
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Not sure — call 16123
or your agriculture officer

13
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
When it can't recognise the problem,
Kom Bish doesn't guess.

14
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Code, live demo and evaluation:
links on screen

15
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:50,000
